  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】鳥取県といえばコレ！鳥取砂丘・松葉ガニ・鳥取和牛・銘酒「千代むすび」＆三朝温泉旅館大橋・皆生温泉華水亭比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-emerald-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🏜️ 日本最大の砂丘「鳥取砂丘」と冬の味覚の王様「松葉ガニ」！世界屈指のラジウム三朝温泉</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">日本海と雄峰・大山に囲まれた鳥取県。風紋が美しい「鳥取砂丘」、境港の水木しげるロード。冬の味覚の王者「松葉ガニ」、幻の海老「モサエビ」、とろける「鳥取和牛」。強力米で仕込む銘酒「千代むすび」「日置桜」「鷹勇」。世界有数のラドン含有量を誇る三朝温泉や皆生温泉で極上の湯治を満喫できます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 鳥取県を代表する最高峰名宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">三朝温泉　旅館　大橋</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.43</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/40046/40046.jpg\" alt=\"三朝温泉　旅館　大橋 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 国登録有形文化財の建築美と奇跡の足元自噴温泉「巌窟の湯」！極上山陰割烹会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">昭和7年創業、館内ほぼ全域が有形文化財の木造建築。天然岩盤から直接湧き出す足元自噴トリウム泉・ラドン泉や松葉ガニ・鳥取和牛料理が至高。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、シニア、記念日、本物の名湯と日本の伝統美を愛する人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>奇跡の足元自噴「巌窟の湯」と有形文化財の空間美なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D40046\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】三朝温泉　旅館　大橋 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">皆生温泉　華水亭</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.57</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/2038/2038.jpg\" alt=\"皆生温泉　華水亭 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 日本海の波打ち際に建つ高級旅館！全室オーシャンビュー露天風呂と海の幸会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">美肌効果の高い皆生温泉。客室露天風呂から日本海と白砂青松を一望し、境港直送の新鮮な魚介会席料理が絶賛されています。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>カップル、記念日、海の絶景温泉を求める人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>日本海一望のオーシャンビュー露天風呂ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D2038\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】皆生温泉　華水亭 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
